{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17919","headline":"琴操十首 · 韩愈","name":"琴操十首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨之施物以孳，我何意於彼爲。\n自周之先，其艰其勤。\n以有疆宇，私我後人。\n我祖在上，四方在下。\n厥临孔威，敢戏以侮。\n孰荒於门，孰治於田。\n四海既均，越裳是臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}